<quiz><question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Determining Conditional Probability on given events</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Suppose that \(P(A | B^c)={@p_a_b_prime@}\), \(P(A)={@p_a@}\) and \(P(B^c)={@p_b_prime@}\) </p>
<p>Determine \(P(B|A)\)</p>
<p>(Note: Leave your answer to \(1\)dp where necessary).</p>
<p> \(P(B|A)=\) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p>
<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<h3>Worked Solution</h3>
<p>\(
\begin{align}
P(B|A)&=\displaystyle \frac{P(B^c)\times P(A|B^c)}{P(B^c)\times P(A|B^c))+P(B) \times P(A|B) }\\
&=\displaystyle \frac{{@decimalplaces(p_b_prime,1)@} \times {@decimalplaces(p_a_b_prime,1)@}} {({@decimalplaces(p_b_prime,1)@}\times {@decimalplaces(p_a_b_prime,1)@})+({@decimalplaces(p_b,1)@} \times {@decimalplaces(p_a_b,1)@}) }\\
&=\displaystyle \frac{{@decimalplaces(p_b_prime*p_a_b_prime,2)@}} {{@decimalplaces(p_b_prime*p_a_b_prime,2)@}+{@decimalplaces(p_b*p_a_b,2)@}}\\
&={@ta1@}\\
\end{align}
\)</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
    <defaultgrade>1.0000000</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.0000000</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
